# Vitest writes these while resolving vitest.config.ts and normally removes them
# again. One sandbox that cannot unlink left three of them behind and `git add -A`
# committed them. Ignored so a build artefact cannot become a source file twice.
vitest.config.ts.timestamp-*.mjs
